# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deploy / infra scratch artifacts (Stage 7.0B security hardening).
# These are pulled from AWS (`aws ecs describe-task-definition`, run-task
# overrides, prisma maintenance overrides) and contain environment-specific
# infra identifiers (AWS account id, IAM role ARNs, Secrets Manager ARNs).
# They MUST NOT be committed. Keep them local only. A sanitized template
# lives at backend/deploy/taskdef.example.json.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
aws
*taskdef*.json
cex-staging-*.json
*-overrides.json
# ...but DO keep the sanitized, placeholder-only template.
!deploy/taskdef.example.json
